    "description": "# RF-15b: Primary/Secondary Referrals — Open Column Definitions\n\n_Columns raised in the mockup that aren't confirmed fields on Sign-Up yet — hold until the client defines them._\n\n### FIELDS\n\n* Logged\n* Referral Status\n* Payment Status\n\n### IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Do not create Logged, Referral Status, or Payment Status as new fields until each one's purpose and population source is confirmed with the client.\n* Referral Status and Payment Status do not exist anywhere on Sign-Up today. Confirm with the client what each should mean and what should set its value before building either.\n\n### NOTES\n\n* Not in scope here: Proof. Resolved without further client input — use the existing Proof Status field instead of Signup Proof, which is a URL field and not useful for this purpose. Already applied to [BUILD-198 — Referrer: Primary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253886041/f/) / [BUILD-199 — Referrer: Secondary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693110159799/f/).\n* Provenance: raised in the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync while reviewing the Primary/Secondary Referrals related lists.\n\n### SOURCE\n\n* Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning — [transcript](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1qB7cUeJGFs_SZba9NX5R9MWKzOj8yTetmWTWoqY3gw8/edit), verified.\n* Dependencies: [BUILD-198 — Referrer: Primary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693253886041/f/), [BUILD-199 — Referrer: Secondary Referrals Related List](https://app.asana.com/0/0/1217693110159799/f/)\n* Owner (proposed): Taryn Reithofer\n* Created 2026-08-24 from the Aug 24 Kobi/Taryn Weekly Planning sync.\n\n",
